# Frontend

Follow `AGENTS.md` sections on clean code, frontend, and security UI.

- Server Components default; client only when needed
- Typed API clients; `credentials: 'include'` + CSRF header on mutations
- Never store JWTs in localStorage
- UI hide ≠ authorization for answers
- TanStack Query for server state; RHF + Zod for forms
- Feature folders; accessible forms
